OL,3,GNEWSANurseries among 320,000 files
OL,4,Aleaked on dark web
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil-run nurseries and special
OL,7,Feducation settings may have been
OL,8,Fimpacted by a hack that saw 320,000
OL,9,Fstolen school files published on the
OL,10,Fdark web.
OL,12,FBristol City Council has created a new
OL,13,Fweb page identifying the 39 schools
OL,14,Ffrom which personal data could have
OL,15,Fbeen stolen during the hack in
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FBristol Hospital Education Service,
OL,19,Fwhich supports children who have
OL,20,Fadditional needs, and Filton Avenue
OL,21,FNursery School are among those listed.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
